  "details": "All avatar's view point position (desktop, half body or full body) has their view point off center, GoGo Loco T Pose controller fixes this issue.\n\nThe black Mayu has the view point position centered using GoGo Loco T Pose controller.\n\nThe yellow Mayu has the view point off center using VRChat's default T Pose controller. Notice how it leans closer to one of the eye bones.\n\nThis can be observed with any avatar!",
